cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this framework, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "SFW AI Character Safety Framework: Romance, Explicit-Content Limits, Minors and Self-Harm Protections"
abstract: >-
  A proposed framework for AI character chat and roleplay platforms that
  separates permitted non-explicit romance (including kissing and light,
  non-graphic touch) from prohibited explicit sexual content, sets hard lines
  on minors and real people, treats self-harm and crisis response as a separate
  safety dimension, and specifies how characters should behave while enforcing
  limits. Includes a detailed policy and 33 test cases with pass criteria. A
  draft proposal, not an industry standard or an independent audit; written by
  the founder of ChatBrat.
type: dataset
authors:
